# [ src/dialogs/ZD01_encounters_battles_and_prisoners/anyone_plyr_party_encounter_hostile_defender_07.py:L1-L5 ] anyone|plyr::party_encounter_hostile_defender->cpsq_liberator_1 [troop_slot_eq] {correct me if i'm mistaken, but you seem to have a close tie wit}
