# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_cpdla2_liberator_6.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::cpdla2_liberator_6->close_window [no_conditions] {so brave, yet so misguided... such a waste.}
