# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_gm_talk_22.py:L1-L7 ] anyone|plyr::gm_talk->gm_promote [neq|faction_slot_eq|neq] {give me leave to promote your guild soldiers in my own ranks.}
