# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_gm_hire2_02.py:L1-L13 ] anyone::gm_hire2->gm_hire3 [eq|assign|try_for_range] {we have some unemployed men in {var}.^^how much soldiers do you }
