# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_rebel_thanks_answer_2.py:L1-L4 ] anyone::rebel_thanks_answer_2->close_window [no_conditions] {i will miss living this life of adventure with you, but my dutie}
