# [ src/dialogs/ZD01_encounters_battles_and_prisoners/anyone_player_siege_ask_surrender_treatment_accept.py:L1-L4 ] anyone::player_siege_ask_surrender_treatment_accept->close_window [no_conditions] {very well then. under those terms, i offer you my surrender.}
