# [ src/dialogs/ZD01_encounters_battles_and_prisoners/anyone_player_siege_ask_leave_unmolested_accept.py:L1-L4 ] anyone::player_siege_ask_leave_unmolested_accept->close_window [no_conditions] {very well. then we leave this castle to you. you have won this d}
