# [ src/dialogs/ZD01_encounters_battles_and_prisoners/anyone_plyr_player_siege_ask_leave_unmolested_02.py:L1-L4 ] anyone|plyr::player_siege_ask_leave_unmolested->player_siege_ask_leave_unmolested_reject [no_conditions] {unacceptable. i want prisoners.}
