# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_lord_start_04.py:L1-L11 ] anyone::lord_start->lord_generic_mission_completed [store_partner_quest|eq|quest_slot_eq] {your surgeon managed to convince my friend and made the operatio}
