# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_lord_start_11.py:L1-L17 ] anyone::lord_start->close_window [store_partner_quest|eq|check_quest_succeeded] {i heard you got rid of that poxy merchant that was causing me so}
