# [ src/dialogs/ZC01_centers_and_economy/anyone_plyr_quest_meet_spy_in_enemy_town_accepted_response.py:L1-L6 ] anyone|plyr::quest_meet_spy_in_enemy_town_accepted_response->quest_meet_spy_in_enemy_town_accepted_2 [quest_get_slot|str_store_party_name_link] {{var} is heavily defended. how can i get close without being not}
