# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_start_69.py:L1-L14 ] anyone::start->lady_qst_duel_for_lady_failed [troop_slot_eq|check_quest_active|check_quest_failed] {i was told that you sought satisfaction from {var} to prove my i}
