# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_start_70.py:L1-L17 ] anyone::start->lady_escort_lady_succeeded [troop_slot_eq|check_quest_active|eq] {thank you for escorting me here, {var}. please accept this gift }
