[anyone|plyr, "tavernkeeper_talk", [], "Keep the room warm. I am going back to the road.", "close_window", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_start_110.py:L1-L5 ] anyone::start->ransom_broker_intro [is_between|eq] {greetings to you, {var}. you look like someone who should get to}
[anyone, "start", [(is_between, "$g_talk_troop", ransom_brokers_begin, ransom_brokers_end),
                    (eq, "$g_talk_troop_met", 0)],
   "Greetings to you, {sir/madam}. You look like someone who should get to know me.", "ransom_broker_intro", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_intro.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_intro->ransom_broker_intro_2 [no_conditions] {why is that?}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_intro", [], "Why is that?", "ransom_broker_intro_2", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_intro_2.py:L1-L10 ] anyone::ransom_broker_intro_2->ransom_broker_info_talk [no_conditions] {i broker ransoms for the poor wretches who are captured in these}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_intro_2", [], "I broker ransoms for the poor wretches who are captured in these endless wars.\
 Normally I travel between the salt mines and the slave markets on the coast, on commission from those whose relatives have gone missing.\
 But if I'm out on my errands of mercy, and I come across a fellow dragging around a captive or two,\
 well, there's no harm in a little speculative investment, is there?\
 And you look like the type who might have a prisoner to sell.", "ransom_broker_info_talk", [(assign, "$ransom_broker_families_told", 0),
                                                                                            (assign, "$ransom_broker_prices_told", 0),
                                                                                            (assign, "$ransom_broker_ransom_me_told", 0),
                                                                                            ]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_info_talk.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_info_talk->ransom_broker_families [eq] {what if their families can't pay?}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_info_talk", [(eq, "$ransom_broker_families_told", 0)], "What if their families can't pay?", "ransom_broker_families", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_families.py:L1-L7 ] anyone::ransom_broker_families->ransom_broker_info_talk [no_conditions] {oh, then i spin them a few heartwarming tales of life on the gal}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_families", [], "Oh, then I spin them a few heartwarming tales of life on the galleys.\
 You'd be surprised what sorts of treasures a peasant can dig out of his cowshed or wheedle out of his cousins,\
 assuming he's got the proper motivation!\
 And if in the end they cannot come up with the silver, then there are always slave merchants who are looking for galley slaves.\
 One cannot do Heaven's work with an empty purse, you see.", "ransom_broker_info_talk", [(assign, "$ransom_broker_families_told", 1)]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_info_talk_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_info_talk->ransom_broker_prices [eq] {name the going price before i start counting chains.}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_info_talk", [(eq, "$ransom_broker_prices_told", 0)], "Name the going price before I start counting chains.", "ransom_broker_prices", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_prices.py:L1-L6 ] anyone::ransom_broker_prices->ransom_broker_info_talk [no_conditions] {it varies. i fancy that i have a fine eye for assessing a ransom}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_prices", [], "It varies. I fancy that I have a fine eye for assessing a ransom.\
 There are a dozen little things about a man that will tell you whether he goes to bed hungry, or dines each night on soft dumplings and goose.\
 The real money of course is in the gentry, and if you ever want to do my job you'll want to learn about every landowning family in Calradia,\
 their estates, their heraldry, their offspring both lawful and bastard, and, of course, their credit with the merchants.", "ransom_broker_info_talk", [(assign, "$ransom_broker_prices_told", 1)]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_info_talk_03.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_info_talk->ransom_broker_ransom_me [eq] {would you be able to ransom me if i were taken?}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_info_talk", [(eq, "$ransom_broker_ransom_me_told", 0)], "Would you be able to ransom me if I were taken?", "ransom_broker_ransom_me", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_ransom_me.py:L1-L5 ] anyone::ransom_broker_ransom_me->ransom_broker_info_talk [no_conditions] {of course. i'm welcome in every court in calradia. there's not m}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_ransom_me", [], "Of course. I'm welcome in every court in Calradia.\
 There's not many who can say that! So always be sure to keep a pot of denars buried somewhere,\
 and a loyal servant who can find it in a hurry.", "ransom_broker_info_talk", [(assign, "$ransom_broker_ransom_me_told", 1)]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_info_talk_04.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_info_talk->ransom_broker_pretalk [no_conditions] {that is enough. i know where the coin sits now.}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_info_talk", [], "That is enough. I know where the coin sits now.", "ransom_broker_pretalk", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_start_111.py:L1-L4 ] anyone::start->ransom_broker_talk [is_between] {greetings. if you have any prisoners, i will be happy to buy the}
[anyone, "start", [(is_between, "$g_talk_troop", ransom_brokers_begin, ransom_brokers_end), ],
   "Greetings. If you have any prisoners, I will be happy to buy them from you.", "ransom_broker_talk", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_pretalk.py:L1-L4 ] anyone::ransom_broker_pretalk->ransom_broker_talk [no_conditions] {anyway, if you have any prisoners, i will be happy to buy them f}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_pretalk", [],
   "Anyway, if you have any prisoners, I will be happy to buy them from you.", "ransom_broker_talk", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_talk.py:L1-L5 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_talk->ransom_broker_sell_prisoners [0|0] {then you'd better bring your purse. i have got prisoners to sell}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_talk",
   [[store_num_regular_prisoners, reg(0)], [ge, reg(0), 1]],
   "Then you'd better bring your purse. I have got prisoners to sell.", "ransom_broker_sell_prisoners", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_talk_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_talk->ransom_broker_hire [no_conditions] {lend me some guards who know how chains change hands.}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_talk", [], "Lend me some guards who know how chains change hands.", "ransom_broker_hire", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_talk_03.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_talk->ransom_broker_intro_2 [no_conditions] {remind me how your ransom trade works before i put names and coi}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_talk", [], "Remind me how your ransom trade works before I put names and coin in your hands.", "ransom_broker_intro_2", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_talk_04.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_talk->close_window [no_conditions] {not this time. good-bye.}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_talk", [], "Not this time. Good-bye.", "close_window", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_diego_watch.py:L1-L9 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_talk->ransom_broker_diego_watch [main_party_has_troop] {diego, watch the cages while i speak with the broker.}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_talk",
  [
    (main_party_has_troop, "trp_diego_companion"),
  ],
  "Diego, watch the cages while I speak with the broker.",
  "ransom_broker_diego_watch",
  []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_diego_watch.py:L1-L8 ] anyone::ransom_broker_diego_watch->ransom_broker_talk [no_conditions] {the one-eyed man says little, but he counts keys, guards, and ex}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_diego_watch", [],
  "The one-eyed man says little, but he counts keys, guards, and exits before he lets me count coin. Fair enough. The trade is cleaner when watched.",
  "ransom_broker_talk",
  [
    (val_add, "$g_sod_diego_anti_slaver_proof", 1),
  ]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_ransom_broker_find_diego.py:L1-L10 ] anyone|plyr::ransom_broker_talk->ransom_broker_find_diego [neg|main_party_has_troop|troop_slot_eq] {i need word carried to diego, the one-eyed man from the slaver p}
[anyone|plyr, "ransom_broker_talk",
  [
    (neg|main_party_has_troop, "trp_diego_companion"),
    (troop_slot_eq, "trp_diego_companion", slot_troop_playerparty_history, pp_history_dismissed),
  ],
  "I need word carried to Diego, the one-eyed man from the Slaver pits.",
  "ransom_broker_find_diego",
  []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_find_diego.py:L1-L8 ] anyone::ransom_broker_find_diego->ransom_broker_talk [no_conditions] {that is not a tavern name. that is an under-road name. i can pas}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_find_diego", [],
  "That is not a tavern name. That is an under-road name. I can pass it through cages, brokers, and released men. If he still wants your road, he will come.",
  "ransom_broker_talk",
  [
    (call_script, "script_sod_diego_rejoin_from_underroad"),
  ]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_sell_prisoners.py:L1-L5 ] anyone::ransom_broker_sell_prisoners->ransom_broker_sell_prisoners_2 [no_conditions] {let me see what you have...}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_sell_prisoners", [],
  "Let me see what you have...", "ransom_broker_sell_prisoners_2",
   [[change_screen_trade_prisoners]]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_sell_prisoners_2.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::ransom_broker_sell_prisoners_2->close_window [no_conditions] {i will be staying here for a few days. let me know if you need m}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_sell_prisoners_2", [], "I will be staying here for a few days. Let me know if you need my services.", "close_window", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_ransom_broker_hire.py:L1-L6 ] anyone::ransom_broker_hire->ransom_broker_sell_prisoners_2 [no_conditions] {i can spare a few of my guards, but please keep my support of yo}
[anyone, "ransom_broker_hire", [], "I can spare a few of my guards, but please keep my support of your cause in mind when your chains are full.", "ransom_broker_sell_prisoners_2", [
  (set_mercenary_source_party, "p_sod_merc_rb"),
  (change_screen_buy_mercenaries),
  ]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_start_112.py:L1-L9 ] anyone::start->tavern_traveler_talk [is_between|call_script|eq] {greetings, friend. you look like the kind of {var} who'd do well}
[anyone, "start", [(is_between, "$g_talk_troop", tavern_travelers_begin, tavern_travelers_end),
                     (call_script, "script_store_troop_name", s10, "$g_talk_troop"),
                     (eq, "$g_talk_troop_met", 0),
                     ],
   "Greetings, friend. You look like the kind of {man/person} who'd do well to know me.\
 I travel a lot all across Calradia and keep an open ear.\
 I can provide you information that you might find useful. For a meager price of course.", "tavern_traveler_talk", [(assign, "$traveler_land_asked", 0)]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_start_113.py:L1-L14 ] anyone::start->tavern_traveler_lost_companion_thanks [is_between|gt|assign] {greetings, {var}. i saw your companion {var} at a tavern in {var}
[anyone, "start",
   [
     (is_between, "$g_talk_troop", tavern_travelers_begin, tavern_travelers_end),
     (gt, "$last_lost_companion", 0),
     (assign, ":companion_found_town", -1),
     (troop_get_slot, ":companion_found_town", "$last_lost_companion", slot_troop_cur_center),
     (is_between, ":companion_found_town", towns_begin, towns_end),
     (call_script, "script_store_troop_name", s10, "$last_lost_companion"),
     (str_store_party_name, s11, ":companion_found_town"),
     ],
   "Greetings, {playername}. I saw your companion {s10} at a tavern in {s11} some days ago. I thought you might like to know.", "tavern_traveler_lost_companion_thanks",
   [(assign, "$last_lost_companion", 0)]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_tavern_traveler_lost_companion_thanks.py:L1-L13 ] anyone|plyr::tavern_traveler_lost_companion_thanks->tavern_traveler_pretalk [troop_get_type|try_begin|eq] {then that is where i ride. if {var} is there, i will find {var}.}
[anyone|plyr, "tavern_traveler_lost_companion_thanks", [
    (troop_get_type, reg3, "$last_lost_companion"),
    (try_begin),
      (eq, reg3, 1),
      (str_store_string, s68, "@she"),
      (str_store_string, s69, "@her"),
    (else_try),
      (str_store_string, s68, "@he"),
      (str_store_string, s69, "@him"),
    (try_end),
  ], "Then that is where I ride. If {s68} is there, I will find {s69}.", "tavern_traveler_pretalk", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_tavern_traveler_lost_companion_thanks_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::tavern_traveler_lost_companion_thanks->tavern_traveler_pretalk [no_conditions] {leave it. that trail is not worth my boots today.}
[anyone|plyr, "tavern_traveler_lost_companion_thanks", [], "Leave it. That trail is not worth my boots today.", "tavern_traveler_pretalk", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_start_114.py:L1-L5 ] anyone::start->tavern_traveler_talk [is_between] {greetings, {var}.}
[anyone, "start", [(is_between, "$g_talk_troop", tavern_travelers_begin, tavern_travelers_end),
                     ],
   "Greetings, {playername}.", "tavern_traveler_talk", [(assign, "$traveler_land_asked", 0)]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_tavern_traveler_pretalk.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::tavern_traveler_pretalk->tavern_traveler_talk [no_conditions] {i have more roads in my head than coins in my purse. what else a}
[anyone, "tavern_traveler_pretalk", [], "I have more roads in my head than coins in my purse. What else are you buying?", "tavern_traveler_talk", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZC02_townsfolk_and_special_npcs/anyone_plyr_tavern_traveler_talk.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::tavern_traveler_talk->tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms [eq] {you have walked more roads than most. what should i know about t}
[anyone|plyr, "tavern_traveler_talk", [(eq, "$traveler_land_asked", 0)], "You have walked more roads than most. What should I know about this land?", "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms", [(assign, "$traveler_land_asked", 1)]],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms.py:L1-L8 ] anyone::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms->tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2 [no_conditions] {calradia is divided between rival kingdoms, which can neither ma}
[anyone, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms", [], "Calradia is divided between rival kingdoms, which can neither manage to live in peace with their neighbours,\
 nor completely eliminate them.\
 As a result, there's seldom a break to the bitter wars which plague this land and drain its life blood.\
 Well, at least this must be a good place to be for an adventurer such as yourself.\
 With some luck and skill, you can make a name for yourself here, amass a fortune perhaps, or gain great power.\
 Opportunities are endless and so are the rewards, if you are willing to risk your life for them.", "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_plyr_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2->tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_3 [no_conditions] {tell me more about these opportunities.}
[anyone|plyr, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2", [], "Tell me more about these opportunities.", "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_3", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_plyr_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2->close_window [no_conditions] {thank you. that was all i needed to know}
[anyone|plyr, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_2", [], "Thank you. That was all I needed to know", "close_window", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_3.py:L1-L4 ] anyone::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_3->tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_4 [gt] {well, you probably know everything i could tell you already. you}
[anyone, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_3", [(gt, "$player_has_homage", 0)], "Well, you probably know everything I could tell you already. You seem to be doing pretty well.",
   "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_4", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_3_02.py:L1-L9 ] anyone::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_3->tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_4 [no_conditions] {the kingdoms will pay good money for mercenaries if they are eng}
[anyone, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_3", [], "The kingdoms will pay good money for mercenaries if they are engaged in a war.\
 If you have done a bit of fighting, speaking with one of their lords will probably result in being offered a mercenary contract.\
 However the real rewards come if you can manage to become a vassal to a king.\
 A vassal can own villages, castles and towns and get rich with the taxes and revenues of these estates.\
 Normally, only nobles of the realm own land in this way,\
 but in time of war, a king will not hesitate to accept someone who distinugishes {himself/herself} on the battlefield as a vassal, and grant {him/her} the right to own land.",
   "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_4", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_4.py:L1-L8 ] anyone::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_4->tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_5 [no_conditions] {the only path closed to a an adventurer such as you would be bec}
[anyone, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_4", [], "The only path closed to a an adventurer such as you would be becoming the {king/queen} of a kingdom.\
 The people and nobles of these lands would never accept an upstart adventurer as their ruler.\
 But don't think that kings can sit on their thrones too comfortably, either. They have their own rivals,\
 those who are born to the right family, who could go around and stir up trouble saying they have a better claim to the throne than the current king.\
 If those claim holders could find supporters, they could easily start civil wars and perhaps even replace the king one day.",
   "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_5", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_plyr_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_5.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_5->tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_6 [no_conditions] {interesting. where can i find these claim holders?}
[anyone|plyr, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_5", [], "Interesting. Where can I find these claim holders?", "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_6", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_plyr_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_5_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_5->close_window [no_conditions] {i guess i heard enough already. thank you.}
[anyone|plyr, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_5", [], "I guess I heard enough already. Thank you.", "close_window", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_6.py:L1-L7 ] anyone::tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_6->tavern_traveler_pretalk [no_conditions] {a claim holder's life would be in danger in his own country of c}
[anyone, "tavern_traveler_tell_kingdoms_6", [], "A claim holder's life would be in danger in his own country of course.\
 Therefore, they usually stay at rival courts, raising support and hoping to find someone willing to champion their cause.\
 I usually hear news about some of them, and may be able to tell you their location with some precision.\
 But of course, I would ask for a little something for such a service.",
   "tavern_traveler_pretalk", [(assign, "$traveller_claimants_mentioned", 1)]],
