# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_novicemaster_are_you_ready.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::novicemaster_are_you_ready->novicemaster_ready_to_fight [no_conditions] {yes i am.}
