# [ src/dialogs/ZC01_centers_and_economy/anyone_plyr_village_elder_talk.py:L1-L10 ] anyone|plyr::village_elder_talk->village_elder_ask_fugitive [check_quest_active|neg|check_quest_concluded|quest_slot_eq] {i am looking for a man by the name of {var}. i was told he may b}
