# [ src/dialogs/ZC01_centers_and_economy/anyone_village_elder_ask_fugitive_02.py:L1-L4 ] anyone::village_elder_ask_fugitive->close_window [no_conditions] {strangers come and go to our village, {var}. if he is hiding her}
