# [ src/dialogs/ZC01_centers_and_economy/anyone_plyr_village_elder_talk_03.py:L1-L4 ] anyone|plyr::village_elder_talk->village_elder_active_mission_1 [store_partner_quest|ge] {about the task you asked of me...}
