# [ src/dialogs/ZC01_centers_and_economy/anyone_plyr_town_dweller_talk_02.py:L1-L13 ] anyone|plyr::town_dweller_talk->town_dweller_quest_meet_spy_in_enemy_town_ask_item [eq|check_quest_active|neg|check_quest_succeeded] {pardon me, but is that a {var} you're wearing?}
